<title>USA: Nobel Insurance Q4 net falls to $0.06..</title>
<headline>Nobel Insurance Q4 net falls to $0.06..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net		 270			2,000</p>
<p> Revs		13,594		   16,675</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.92		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net		 4,287		    6,232</p>
<p> Revs		72,858		   61,269</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name is Nobel Insurance Ltd. It is based in Bermuda.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results included a gain of $173,000, or $0.04 per share, for capital gains.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
